<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-HOSTS UAE BEAT IRAQ 1-0 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER FINALS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HOSTS UAE BEAT IRAQ 1-0 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hosts the United Arab Emirates</p>
<p>beat Iraq 1-0 with a ''golden goal'' in extra time in an Asian</p>
<p>Cup quarter-final tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Abdel Hussain 103</p>
<p>Attendence: 50,000</p>
</text>
